    "chunk_text": "halgan w\u00e6re Furtunato, he s\u00e6nde men sona \u00e6fter & het to him \u00dea se Godes man w\u00e6s sprecende to \u00feam Gotum mid li\u00f0um wor\u00f0um & tihhode, \u00fe\u00e6t he sceolde & \u00fea \u00e6fter \u00feon he spr\u00e6c \u00feus & cw\u00e6\u00f0: hwylc weor\u00f0 willa\u00f0 ge \u00fe\u00e6t ic sylle eow, & ge me agyfan \u00dea se \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r yldost w\u00e6s him andswarode & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00f0: swa hw\u00e6t swa \u00feu elles bebeodest, we Witodlice \u00feas cnihtas we nateshwon ne gifa\u00f0. \u00dea se arwyr\u00f0a wer w\u00e6s beotigende swi\u00f0e li\u00f0elice to \u00feam & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00f0: \u00feu me unrotsast nu \u00feu Ac nylle \u00feu me ma unrotsian, \u00fey l\u00e6s hit \u00fee eft of\u00feynce. Ac \u00fea gyt se ylca Gota \u00feurhwunode on his heortan re\u00f0nysse & swa wi\u00f0sacende onweg gewat. \u00dea \u00feam o\u00f0rum d\u00e6ge eode he eft, o\u00f0 he com to \u00feam biscope. & \u00fea b\u00e6d se biscop hine eft \u00fe\u00e6s mid \u00feam ylcum wordum \u00feara forecwedena cnihta. & \u00fea \u00fea he nolde n\u00e6nigra \u00feinga ge\u00feafa beon, \u00fe\u00e6t he hi agyfan wolde, \u00fea w\u00e6s se biscop swi\u00f0e Se Gota forseah \u00fea word ealle & eft gecyrde to his huse & \u00fea ylcan cnihtas asette on his hors. Be \u00feam w\u00e6s \u00feus gedon: he s\u00e6nde hi beforan him mid his mannum & him sylf sona strad upon & \u00fea \u00fea he com in \u00f0\u00e6re ylcan c\u00e6stre beforan \u00fe\u00e6re cyrcan \u00fe\u00e6s eadigan apostoles sancte Pet",
